0472F0             0384*   ; Draw the player record after an actor-owned scripted update.
0472F0             0385*   ; inputs: IY = player record
0472F0             0386*   player_draw_record:
0472F0 FD 7E 00    0387*       ld a,(iy+sprite_id)
