047308             0395*   ; to flush queued sprite positions. Publish the move now; otherwise the VDP
047308             0396*   ; holds every entrance/death update until grace resumes world drawing and the
047308             0397*   ; ship appears to teleport to its final position.
047308 CD 1B 1B 04 0398*       call vdu_sprite_update
04730C C9          0399*       ret
